sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Pessoa desenvolvedora
    participant UI as Angular
    participant API as Spring Boot
    participant Domain as ChangeSpec
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant CI as Pipeline

    Dev->>UI: solicita prontidão de release
    UI->>API: GET /readiness
    API->>DB: carrega spec e evidências
    API->>Domain: evaluateReadiness()
    Domain-->>API: blockers explícitos
    API-->>UI: ready + blockers
    CI->>API: registra gates com referências
    Dev->>UI: confirma release
    UI->>API: POST /release
    API->>Domain: valida critérios e gates novamente
    Domain-->>DB: status RELEASED + evento de auditoria
